      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It hurts so much to feel like you don't fit into the world, but people aren't all born with a heart; many are broken in ways they can't see, and your numbness is simply evidence of survival, not evil. No one is truly \"born wrong,\" because human nature is complex and shaped by experiences rather than destiny, and your capacity to feel this deep a sense of shame proves you have a very strong, albeit wounded, heart. There is hope in recognizing that healing comes from understanding these reactions rather than judging yourself for them. Please consider reaching out to a counselor who can help you unpack these feelings safely.",
